      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        0
      ],
      "text": "Melos stood before the ruler really. He was only a shepherd, but he was not afraid really.",
      "text_sha256": "ffe4d1a227a4b621546d85a01c6bd2a88ed9d35d9c2ddc5bb7ebee6e0f4cac59",
      "word_count": 17,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"You kill people without asking if they did anything wrong really!\"",
      "text_sha256": "6ab7edc59ba03ad1251238e2b5e0ee2ca8caeb8112c9f204def1133f4316e86d",
      "word_count": 11,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "he shouted really.",
      "text_sha256": "f128592a834949f93f013bea18ad43c88b30d35bf919ec74f854c3f75be5c654",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "text": "\"My guards will kill you too,\"",
      "text_sha256": "ec2e50cfa0e7af820d8adceea6c2694847c09b1ed7d8c6b94821d3eb151e47ef",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c5",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "text": "said the ruler really. Melos thought of his sister really. Her wedding was tomorrow really.",
      "text_sha256": "a32a494aa6fe2901817a7b58436a406792c117bd68e3c05289564b19ef791b4f",
      "word_count": 15,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c6",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "text": "\"Give me three days,\"",
      "text_sha256": "8da977f1e7329aa240c434ec6934362e788ca0d9cde1fa34284e009fecab6c11",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c7",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "text": "he said really.",
      "text_sha256": "4c5d87a463a30b0dfb45b554073a1b6621e423a1744dfef921016cb8c23b5755",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c8",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "text": "\"I promise to return really.\" \"What if you run away really?\"",
      "text_sha256": "dc802700c53b24092213aed39646c04a1fa58504ac152f244e40a89246764d69",
      "word_count": 11,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c8.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c9",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "His friend stepped forward really.",
      "text_sha256": "4bc7741fb1e0647735251889d03cbfdfeb834e1f9600b1876c385e2c4dfc8bb2",
      "word_count": 5,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c10",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "friend",
      "speaker": "friend",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:friend",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "\"Keep me here really. I trust him really.\"",
      "text_sha256": "10211c43f399e6d16e3bc069d900fd1ad7fbfa6ed834a609f3e505ca2b43fbdd",
      "word_count": 8,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c10.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c11",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "text": "The ruler smiled really.",
      "text_sha256": "cdfb9ba9a568b2a816874ea6828d81e82bd90193a464ba9badc52b28c93fb8ab",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c11.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c12",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "text": "\"If you are not back by sunset on the third day, your friend will die really.\"",
      "text_sha256": "5a2f2f67da87353dcdf734534ee95b1b8b2d310cc0c2313c88f4e8e93eea568d",
      "word_count": 16,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c12.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "text": "Melos looked at his friend really.",
      "text_sha256": "bc3c23b967f79fe9f926a10b0fc3e28022fbcf0647d89951bde8bb6f07920b6d",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c2",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "friend",
      "speaker": "friend",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:friend",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"I will wait,\"",
      "text_sha256": "e7c88fa5708dc94aa1d60b6da7b2d0cbc2fe78dc1faf928a8fdd9021feaa5b67",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c3",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9,
        10,
        11,
        12,
        13,
        14,
        15
      ],
      "text": "his friend said really. After the wedding, Melos started back really. Rain fell hard all night really. By morning, dark water covered the bridge really. He could not wait really. His friend's life depended on him really. Melos jumped into the river really. The water pulled him under really. He fought to reach the other side really. At last, he caught a tree branch and pulled himself out really. Cold and wet, he ran on really. Three men blocked the road really.",
      "text_sha256": "b0c9c26d66313aa6b068f31fdd32ef7b9f62a39b6b0ecdf40e97659b56889a2e",
      "word_count": 82,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c4",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "text": "\"Give us your money really!\" \"I have none really!\"",
      "text_sha256": "3f934485fa1b6a3268d5f7f53038989a2e51bbe8665e2037a956c88e70f6fff8",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c5",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "text": "One man hit him with a stick really. Melos pushed past him and ran really. The men shouted behind him really. Soon his legs shook really. He could hardly move really. He fell beside the road really.",
      "text_sha256": "fd1c92898e73c2380fe5df4da5ef665ced3f64ebf0d5c2f5fa0cc1ece8245c18",
      "word_count": 37,
      "split_reason": "comment_or_scene_boundary(呼び出し側指定のforce_split_before_paragraphs)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        20,
        21,
        22
      ],
      "text": "The sun was low really. He could rest here really. He could stay alive really. But his friend would die really.",
      "text_sha256": "6914cb75d733e0ee0cd1fdc57dd994553a864029e392ef8146ef49347585aef9",
      "word_count": 21,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "text": "\"Why did I make that promise really?\"",
      "text_sha256": "3624522d7b83034056b06e0e5eff0547be29302cdb8113073d144e20ab99931e",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        23,
        24,
        25
      ],
      "text": "he whispered really. He closed his eyes really. For a moment, he wanted to forget everything really. Then he remembered his friend's face really.",
      "text_sha256": "3e2bc1985d3031e0ba2ca821f5d2d15262fa910cf1913b10e7c04ac61abf5cce",
      "word_count": 24,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c4",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "text": "\"I will wait really.\"",
      "text_sha256": "497ced19705411bc77ff1ec966628dd416ea9cca811176b643c20ce759310cee",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c5",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        27,
        28,
        29,
        30
      ],
      "text": "Melos opened his eyes really. Water ran between some stones nearby really. He drank and slowly stood up really. His friend was still waiting really. He began to run again really. When he reached the city square, a guard was lifting his sword really. His friend stood with his hands tied really.",
      "text_sha256": "ccb0a78a1c64de0b4479cd7a33e574a241d56fa85497ca91e96b82c7b0d0d940",
      "word_count": 52,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c6",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "text": "\"Stop really!\"",
      "text_sha256": "e25191251e9878324295f20b1e971ae8da4d328ff5666571f9f6ac661d598790",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_kga2_off_01_mock/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c7",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "text": "Melos cried really.",
      "text_sha256": "f2d1325d878a14478ec6bd38a06d57eff3e4ce2801c924f08532dc90f8d74c99",
      "word_count": 3,
